{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Sīha","html":"<article id='thag1.83'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.83 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.83 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Navamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Nine </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Sīhattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sīha </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sīhappamatto vihara, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Meditate diligently, Sīha, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>rattindivamatandito; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>tireless all day and night. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bhāvehi kusalaṁ dhammaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Develop skillful qualities, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>jaha sīghaṁ samussayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and quickly discard this bag of bones. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Sīho thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
